				<textElement>
					<paragraph leftIndent="5"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[Note:
1.  The list of products and services is not exhaustive and not mutually exclusive.  Individual NBDTIs are required to fill-in all their products and services as per their ML/TF risk assessment.
2. Please include additional rows as required.
3. Debit and Credit is with reference to the NBDTI's customers. Debit will refer to transactions where the customer's account is debited and credit will refer to transactions where the customer's account is credited.]]></text>
